## rules.yaml
briefing =
    Somewhere in this area there is a GDI Advanced Communications Center.
    Inside this center are the firing codes for their orbiting Ion station.

    The Brotherhood must have these codes. Capture the Center and retrieve
    the codes, do not destroy the center.

## lua
