ion-cannon-online = Warning: the GDI Ion Cannon is now online.
destroy-gdi-construction-yard = Destroy the GDI Construction Yard to stop their reinforcements.
destroy-gdi-communications-center = Destroy the GDI Communications Center to stop the airstrikes.
